cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "AcqSearch"
abstract: "Spatial acquisition search for an optical terminal — spiral, raster, Lissajous and random-restart scan patterns over a declared 2-D pointing-uncertainty cone with declared beam divergence, detector field of view, dwell time, slew rate and per-dwell detection probability including false alarms; coverage fraction against time, expected acquisition time computed analytically where the geometry allows and by seeded Monte Carlo otherwise with the two cross-checked, optimal dwell from the detection-probability trade, and a learned adaptive scan-order policy benchmarked against both the fixed pattern and the Bayesian-greedy posterior update."
type: software
authors:
